  "boundaries": [
    "sharing routes require the local administrator permission policy",
    "provider calls use typed Shared Center ports and Fake/Stub responses",
    "summary, local shares, manual validation, virtual-import listing and media search are read-only PostgreSQL projections and do not call Shared Center in the request thread",
    "summary and credit refresh use the local append-only contribution ledger as the only balance fact and ignore the legacy Shared Center snapshot",
    "maintenance submission creates or replays a persistent shared-resource-maintenance Job with max_attempts one and does not run provider work in the request thread",
    "mutation payloads are validated as JSON objects and persisted only in the durable sharing operation record; Outbox and Celery payloads contain identifiers only",
    "Shared Center mutations return a durable operation handle and never call the provider in the request thread; quote remains a bounded synchronous query",
    "source report and reregister freeze the local source/file/RAW snapshot, execute RAW upload as a durable prerequisite, release source registration only after RAW confirmation, and apply provider receipt plus local projection in one terminal UoW",
    "center import freezes bounded source identity in the request thread; virtual projection and account-bound Rapid transfer run only in the durable Worker after one provider-write checkpoint",
    "virtual retirement requires exact Emby absence readback, digest-owned STRM cleanup and a terminal continuation that deletes the local row in the operation UoW",
    "Rapid transfer recovery never resends lease, upload-init, sign-job creation or signed finalize; it uses the frozen account/backend/credential/target/file manifest and authoritative target-directory readback",
    "operation status and cancellation are owned by /api/shared/resources/operations/{operation_id}; duplicate identity replays and active scope conflicts are fenced",
    "pre-request cancellation terminalizes locally and releases transfer escrow exactly once; cancellation after the provider checkpoint records intent but continues authoritative readback without resend or escrow release",
    "real Shared Center, Emby, Telegram and HDHive acceptance remains HUMAN_PENDING"
  ],
